<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Terra Industries started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Terra Industries started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney confirmed it initiated coverage of Terra Industries Inc with a neutral rating and set a $14 per share price target.</p>
<p>-- set 1997 earnings estimates of $1.65 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
